---
/**
 * WarehousePickingStory.astro
 * Canonical Mobile Specification for Warehouse & FEFO Picking Operations
 * Blueprint Traceability: MOB-US-011..019, MOB-US-050..056 (MOBILE-EPIC-02 & 08)
 * Canonical Persona: Alejandro · Operador de Almacén Frigorífico Central
 * Canonical Client: La Cava Fría
 * Canonical Order: DSP-204
 * Canonical Location: Pasillo B · Rack 04 · Nivel 2 · Posición 12 (B-04-N2-P12)
 * Canonical Product: Salmón Salar Congelado 4-5kg (SKU ALM-LMO-982) · Lote FEFO L-20260914-A
 */
---

<div class="story-screen-container" id="story-bodega">
  
  <!-- Web-Style Documentation Heading -->
  <header class="section-heading-block">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span class="section-index">02</span>
      <div>
        <p class="section-kicker">WAREHOUSE / FEFO PICKING · BLUEPRINT MOBILE-EPIC-02 & 08</p>
        <h2>Alejandro — Operaciones de Picking en Frío y Validación de Lotes FEFO</h2>
        <p class="section-intro">
          Especificación canónica nativa en <strong>Android Jetpack Compose</strong> para terminales industriales robustas de almacén (Zebra TC58 / Honeywell ScanPal). Implementa navegación guiada por estantería (<code>B-04-N2-P12</code>), recomendación algorítmica <em>First-Expired, First-Out</em> (FEFO), telemetría térmica continua en sensor calibrado a <code>3.8°C</code>, escáner CameraX en ráfaga (burst scanning) y protocolo de discrepancia con segregación a cuarentena física y lógica.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Quick Meta Chips -->
    <div class="heading-meta-chips">
      <span class="doc-chip tone-info"><i class="pi pi-box" aria-hidden="true"></i> Orden DSP-204 · La Cava Fría</span>
      <span class="doc-chip tone-neutral"><i class="pi pi-map" aria-hidden="true"></i> Pasillo B · Rack 04 · N2 · P12</span>
      <span class="doc-chip tone-info"><i class="pi pi-clock" aria-hidden="true"></i> Lote FEFO L-20260914-A (19d vcto.)</span>
      <span class="doc-chip tone-success"><i class="pi pi-sun" aria-hidden="true"></i> Sensor Calibrado 3.8°C (2°C – 6°C)</span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Interactive Story Workbench: 2-Column Responsive Layout -->
  <div class="story-workbench-layout">
    
    <!-- Left: Step Flow & Functional Blueprint Details -->
    <div class="story-details-col">
      
      <!-- Phase Navigation Bar -->
      <nav class="phase-selector-bar" role="tablist" aria-label="Fases de Picking FEFO">
        <button type="button" class="phase-btn active" data-phase="location">
          <span class="phase-badge">01</span>
          <span>Ubicación Rack</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="phase-btn" data-phase="fefo">
          <span class="phase-badge">02</span>
          <span>Lote & FEFO</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="phase-btn" data-phase="temp">
          <span class="phase-badge">03</span>
          <span>Sensor 3.8°C</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="phase-btn" data-phase="discrepancy">
          <span class="phase-badge">04</span>
          <span>Cuarentena</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="phase-btn" data-phase="code">
          <span class="phase-badge">05</span>
          <span>Código Compose</span>
        </button>
      </nav>

      <!-- Phase 1: Location Rack -->
      <div class="phase-panel active" id="panel-phase-location">
        <article class="evidence-card">
          <div class="card-kicker-row">
            <span class="card-step-badge">FASE 01</span>
            <span class="card-mono-id">DSP-204 · LA CAVA FRÍA · B-04-N2-P12</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="card-title">Localización Guiada en Cámara Frigorífica</h3>
          <p class="card-desc">
            Ruta de picking secuenciada por cercanía y zona térmica. La nomenclatura de ubicación se presenta en tipografía monoespaciada de <code>22sp bold</code> legible a distancia sobre montacargas o transpaleta.
          </p>
          <div class="evidence-grid">
            <div class="evidence-item">
              <i class="pi pi-compass text-primary" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              <div>
                <strong>Coordenada de Estantería</strong>
                <p><code>B-04-N2-P12</code> (Pasillo B · Rack 04 · Nivel 2 · Posición 12)</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="evidence-item">
              <i class="pi pi-box text-primary" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              <div>
                <strong>SKU Consignado</strong>
                <p>Salmón Salar Congelado 4-5kg (SKU ALM-LMO-982)</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="evidence-item">
              <i class="pi pi-tags text-info" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              <div>
                <strong>Cantidad Solicitada</strong>
                <p>16 Cajas (20kg c/u = 320 kg neto)</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="evidence-item">
              <i class="pi pi-building text-neutral" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              <div>
                <strong>Cliente Destino</strong>
                <p>La Cava Fría (Lima · North Hub)</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <!-- Phase 2: FEFO Lot Verification -->
      <div class="phase-panel" id="panel-phase-fefo">
        <article class="evidence-card">
          <div class="card-kicker-row">
            <span class="card-step-badge">FASE 02</span>
            <span class="card-mono-id">FEFO ALGORITHM · STRICT ROTATION</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="card-title">Algoritmo FEFO y Control de Rotación de Caducidad</h3>
          <p class="card-desc">
            En productos perecederos de alto valor, el motor de reservas bloquea el escaneo de lotes con mayor vida útil remanente si existe stock con caducidad más cercana.
          </p>
          <div class="fefo-comparison-table">
            <div class="fefo-row recommended">
              <span class="fefo-badge ok"><i class="pi pi-check"></i> LOTE ASIGNADO OBLIGATORIO</span>
              <div class="fefo-data">
                <strong>Lote FEFO L-20260914-A</strong>
                <small>Caducidad: 14 Oct 2026 · Restan 19 días · Palet #PLT-9810</small>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="fefo-row alternative">
              <span class="fefo-badge warn"><i class="pi pi-ban"></i> LOTE RESTRINGIDO (FEFO SUPERIOR)</span>
              <div class="fefo-data">
                <strong>Lote L-20261120-B</strong>
                <small>Caducidad: 20 Nov 2026 · Restan 56 días · Requiere anulación de supervisor</small>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <!-- Phase 3: Calibrated Temp Sensor -->
      <div class="phase-panel" id="panel-phase-temp">
        <article class="evidence-card">
          <div class="card-kicker-row">
            <span class="card-step-badge">FASE 03</span>
            <span class="card-mono-id">BLE TELEMETRY · SENSOR CALIBRADO 3.8°C</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="card-title">Telemetría Térmica Continua en Cámara Fría</h3>
          <p class="card-desc">
            Lectura en tiempo real vinculada mediante Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE) con la sonda térmica del pasillo B. La confirmación de picking exige registro de temperatura dentro de la banda aceptable (2.0°C – 6.0°C).
          </p>
          <div class="evidence-grid">
            <div class="evidence-item">
              <i class="pi pi-sun text-success" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              <div>
                <strong>Sensor Calibrado ID: TH-B04</strong>
                <p>Lectura actual: <strong>3.8°C</strong> (Rango óptimo: 2°C – 6°C)</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="evidence-item">
              <i class="pi pi-shield text-primary" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              <div>
                <strong>Certificado de Calibración</strong>
                <p>INACAL-2026-T892 (Vigente hasta Dic 2026)</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <!-- Phase 4: Discrepancy & Quarantine -->
      <div class="phase-panel" id="panel-phase-discrepancy">
        <article class="evidence-card">
          <div class="card-kicker-row">
            <span class="card-step-badge">FASE 04</span>
            <span class="card-mono-id">INCIDENT FLOW · PHYSICAL & LOGICAL QUARANTINE</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="card-title">Protocolo de Discrepancia y Cuarentena Preventiva</h3>
          <p class="card-desc">
            Si se detecta daño en empaque térmico, rotura de precinto o diferencia de conteo físico, el operador traslada las cajas a cuarentena física sin eliminar la trazabilidad del lote.
          </p>
          <div class="quarantine-protocol-box">
            <div class="quarantine-step">
              <span class="q-badge">1</span>
              <span>Captura fotográfica CameraX de caja dañada con escaneo de código 2D.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="quarantine-step">
              <span class="q-badge">2</span>
              <span>Reubicación física a Jaula de Cuarentena Fría (C-QUA-01).</span>
            </div>
            <div class="quarantine-step">
              <span class="q-badge">3</span>
              <span>Notificación automática al Jefe de Patio Almacén (Carlos Mendoza).</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <!-- Phase 5: Compose Code -->
      <div class="phase-panel" id="panel-phase-code">
        <section class="compose-code-container">
          <div class="code-card-header">
            <div class="code-title-group">
              <i class="pi pi-android" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              <span class="code-tag">Android Jetpack Compose · Material 3</span>
            </div>
            <span class="code-path">:apps:operations-android/picking/WarehousePickingScreen.kt</span>
          </div>
          <pre class="compose-code"><code><span class="kw">@Composable</span>
<span class="kw">fun</span> <span class="fn">WarehousePickingScreen</span>(
    state: <span class="type">WarehousePickingUiState</span>,
    onBurstBarcodeScan: (barcode: <span class="type">String</span>) -&gt; <span class="type">Unit</span>,
    onAdjustQuantity: (delta: <span class="type">Int</span>) -&gt; <span class="type">Unit</span>,
    onReportQuarantine: (lotId: <span class="type">String</span>, reason: <span class="type">String</span>) -&gt; <span class="type">Unit</span>,
    onConfirmPick: () -&gt; <span class="type">Unit</span>,
    modifier: <span class="type">Modifier</span> = <span class="type">Modifier</span>
) &#123;
    <span class="type">Scaffold</span>(
        topBar = &#123;
            <span class="type">TopAppBar</span>(
                title = &#123; <span class="type">Text</span>(<span class="str">"Picking DSP-204 · La Cava Fría"</span>) &#125;,
                colors = <span class="type">TopAppBarDefaults</span>.<span class="fn">topAppBarColors</span>(
                    containerColor = <span class="type">NexaTheme</span>.colors.surfaceCard
                )
            )
        &#125;
    ) &#123; innerPadding -&gt;
        <span class="type">Column</span>(
            modifier = modifier.<span class="fn">padding</span>(innerPadding).<span class="fn">fillMaxSize</span>(),
            verticalArrangement = <span class="type">Arrangement</span>.<span class="fn">spacedBy</span>(<span class="num">12</span>.dp)
        ) &#123;
            <span class="type">RackLocationBanner</span>(
                aisle = <span class="str">"Pasillo B"</span>,
                rack = <span class="str">"Rack 04"</span>,
                level = <span class="str">"Nivel 2"</span>,
                position = <span class="str">"Posición 12"</span>,
                formattedCode = <span class="str">"B-04-N2-P12"</span>
            )
            <span class="type">FefoLotRecommendationCard</span>(
                skuName = <span class="str">"Salmón Salar Congelado 4-5kg"</span>,
                skuCode = <span class="str">"ALM-LMO-982"</span>,
                lotNumber = <span class="str">"L-20260914-A"</span>,
                daysRemaining = <span class="num">19</span>,
                calibratedTemp = <span class="num">3.8f</span>
            )
            <span class="type">GloveFriendlyStepper56dp</span>(
                current = state.pickedUnits,
                target = state.requiredUnits,
                onIncrement = &#123; onAdjustQuantity(+<span class="num">1</span>) &#125;,
                onDecrement = &#123; onAdjustQuantity(-<span class="num">1</span>) &#125;
            )
        &#125;
    &#125;
&#125;</code></pre>
        </section>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Right: Smartphone Hardware Simulator Preview (Zebra TC58 Terminal) -->
    <div class="story-preview-col">
      <div class="device-chassis-shell">
        
        <!-- Status Bar -->
        <div class="android-status-bar">
          <span class="status-clock">10:15</span>
          <div class="status-icons-cluster">
            <span class="conn-tag">WIFI-WMS</span>
            <i class="pi pi-wifi" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <span class="battery-pct">94%</span>
            <i class="pi pi-bolt battery-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Compose Viewport -->
        <div class="compose-screen-viewport">
          
          <!-- Top App Bar -->
          <div class="compose-top-app-bar">
            <button type="button" class="btn-app-icon" title="Volver al tablero">
              <i class="pi pi-arrow-left" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            </button>
            <div class="appbar-title-block">
              <span class="appbar-headline">Picking DSP-204</span>
              <span class="appbar-sub">La Cava Fría · Almacén Central</span>
            </div>
            <span class="status-laser-chip" title="Escáner láser activo">
              <i class="pi pi-barcode" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            </span>
          </div>

          <!-- Scrollable Content -->
          <div class="compose-scroll-content">
            
            <!-- High-Visibility Location Banner (B-04-N2-P12) -->
            <div class="rack-location-banner">
              <span class="banner-sub">PASILLO B · RACK 04 · NIVEL 2</span>
              <strong class="banner-code">B-04-N2-P12</strong>
              <span class="banner-pos-label">Posición 12 · Cámara Fría Principal</span>
            </div>

            <!-- Product Card & FEFO Recommendation -->
            <div class="compose-card fefo-product-card">
              <div class="card-header-line">
                <span class="order-tag">SKU ALM-LMO-982</span>
                <span class="cold-chip"><i class="pi pi-snowflake" aria-hidden="true"></i> Congelado -18°C</span>
              </div>
              <h4 class="buyer-heading">Salmón Salar Congelado 4-5kg</h4>
              <p class="destination-line">Cajas master 20kg · Envase al vacío sellado</p>

              <!-- FEFO Lot Verification Chip -->
              <div class="fefo-active-box">
                <div class="fefo-header-row">
                  <span class="fefo-tag-ok"><i class="pi pi-check"></i> FEFO OBLIGATORIO</span>
                  <span class="fefo-days-left">19 días para vencimiento</span>
                </div>
                <strong class="fefo-lot-code">Lote: L-20260914-A</strong>
                <small class="fefo-note">Palet #PLT-9810 · Prioridad de salida #1 en pasillo</small>
              </div>

              <!-- Sensor Calibrado Telemetry -->
              <div class="sensor-reading-bar">
                <div class="sensor-info-line">
                  <span class="sensor-title"><i class="pi pi-sun" aria-hidden="true"></i> Sensor Calibrado (Sonda B-04):</span>
                  <strong class="sensor-degrees">3.8°C</strong>
                </div>
                <small class="sensor-range-tag">Rango conforme: 2.0°C – 6.0°C (Certificado INACAL)</small>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 56dp Glove-Friendly Quantity Stepper -->
            <div class="compose-card glove-stepper-card">
              <div class="stepper-header-line">
                <span class="card-subhead">CONTEO DE BULTOS (TOUCH TARGET 56dp):</span>
                <span class="stepper-kg-total">320 kg neto</span>
              </div>

              <div class="stepper-controls-row">
                <button type="button" class="btn-glove-stepper" id="btn-pick-minus" aria-label="Restar 1 caja">
                  <i class="pi pi-minus" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                </button>
                <div class="stepper-number-display">
                  <strong class="stepper-current-val" id="stepper-count">16</strong>
                  <span class="stepper-target-label">de 16 Cajas Solicitadas</span>
                </div>
                <button type="button" class="btn-glove-stepper" id="btn-pick-plus" aria-label="Sumar 1 caja">
                  <i class="pi pi-plus" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                </button>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- CameraX Barcode Burst Scanning Button -->
            <button type="button" class="btn-glove-primary btn-camerax-scan">
              <i class="pi pi-qrcode" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              <span>Escanear Ráfaga con CameraX (GS1-128)</span>
            </button>

            <!-- Quarantine Discrepancy Flow -->
            <button type="button" class="btn-quarantine-trigger">
              <i class="pi pi-exclamation-triangle" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              <span>Reportar Discrepancia / Enviar a Cuarentena</span>
            </button>

            <!-- Confirm Pick Button -->
            <button type="button" class="btn-glove-confirm">
              <i class="pi pi-check-circle" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              <span>Confirmar Picking y Transferir a Muelle 3</span>
            </button>

          </div>

          <!-- Bottom Navigation -->
          <div class="compose-bottom-nav">
            <div class="bnav-tab active">
              <i class="pi pi-list" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              <span>Picking</span>
            </div>
            <div class="bnav-tab">
              <i class="pi pi-compass" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              <span>Racks</span>
            </div>
            <div class="bnav-tab">
              <i class="pi pi-shield" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              <span>Cuarentena</span>
            </div>
            <div class="bnav-tab">
              <i class="pi pi-history" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              <span>Historial</span>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

        <div class="android-gesture-pill"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

</div>

<style>
  .story-screen-container {
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--nexa-space-6, 24px);
  }

  .section-heading-block {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    padding-bottom: 24px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--nexa-color-border-structural, #e2e8f0);
  }

  .section-heading {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 38px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: var(--nexa-space-3, 12px);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .section-index {
    color: var(--nexa-color-primary-600, #2563eb);
    font: 700 var(--nexa-font-size-sm, 14px) / 1.4 var(--nexa-font-family-mono, monospace);
  }

  .section-kicker {
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    color: var(--nexa-color-primary-700, #1d4ed8);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .section-heading h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font: 800 clamp(22px, 3vw, 30px) / 1.16 var(--nexa-font-family-display, sans-serif);
    letter-spacing: -.03em;
    color: var(--nexa-color-text-primary, #0f172a);
  }

  .section-intro {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 10px 0 0;
    color: var(--nexa-color-text-secondary, #64748b);
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .heading-meta-chips {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .doc-chip {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }

  .doc-chip.tone-info { background: #eff6ff; color: #1e40af; border: 1px solid #bfdbfe; }
  .doc-chip.tone-neutral { background: #f8fafc; color: #334155; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }
  .doc-chip.tone-success { background: #ecfdf5; color: #065f46; border: 1px solid #a7f3d0; }

  .story-workbench-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 390px;
    gap: 32px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1100px) {
    .story-workbench-layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .story-details-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .phase-selector-bar {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px;
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid var(--nexa-color-border-structural, #e2e8f0);
    padding: 6px;
    border-radius: 12px;
  }

  .phase-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    background: transparent;
    border: 0;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #475569;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
  }

  .phase-badge {
    font-family: var(--nexa-font-family-mono, monospace);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 800;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .phase-btn:hover { background: #f1f5f9; color: #0f172a; }
  .phase-btn.active { background: var(--nexa-color-primary-600, #2563eb); color: #ffffff; font-weight: 700; }
  .phase-btn.active .phase-badge { opacity: 1; }

  .phase-panel { display: none; }
  .phase-panel.active { display: block; animation: fadeIn 0.2s ease-out; }

  @keyframes fadeIn {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(4px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  .evidence-card {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid var(--nexa-color-border-structural, #e2e8f0);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 24px;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
  }

  .card-kicker-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .card-step-badge {
    background: #082846;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 800;
    padding: 2px 7px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .card-mono-id {
    font-family: var(--nexa-font-family-mono, monospace);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--nexa-color-primary-700, #1d4ed8);
  }

  .card-title {
    font-family: var(--nexa-font-family-display, sans-serif);
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--nexa-color-text-primary, #0f172a);
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }

  .card-desc {
    color: var(--nexa-color-text-secondary, #64748b);
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0 0 18px;
  }

  .evidence-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 14px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .evidence-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .evidence-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: flex-start;
